+### 硬件与依赖
+
+- A740 GPU/GMU registers, GPU SMMU streams 0/1 and GMU stream 5, signed ZAP firmware and board power votes.
+- Turnip, metal2vulkan, AIR translation and the selected OS GPU/Metal ABI.
